{"kind":"doc","route":"/resources/effect-adoption","title":"Adopting CraftTS progressively","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"adopting-craftts-progressively","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Adopting CraftTS progressively"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"You do not need to rewrite an Effect application before evaluating CraftTS. Keep"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the domain programs and Layers intact, then introduce Craft at the browser"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"boundary one feature at a time."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"recommended-path","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Recommended path"}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"_0-establish-the-constraints","children":[{"t":"text","text":"0. Establish the constraints"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Before changing application code, confirm the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/resources/effect-compatibility","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"compatibility matrix"}]},{"t":"text","text":". In particular, check"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the Effect 4 release-candidate requirement, the Node version and whether SSR is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a hard requirement."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"_1-keep-the-domain-in-effect","children":[{"t":"text","text":"1. Keep the domain in Effect"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Select one existing operation with a clear type:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"Effect"},{"text":"<","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"Output, BusinessError, RequiredServices","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":">","kind":"keyword"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keep its "},{"t":"code","text":"Context.Service"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"Layer"},{"t":"text","text":", tagged errors and tests. The first Craft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"change should be an adapter, not a rewrite of the business logic."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"_2-add-the-craft-boundary","children":[{"t":"text","text":"2. Add the Craft boundary"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Install "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/effect"},{"t":"text","text":", install the bridge once at bootstrap, and expose the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"operation through "},{"t":"code","text":"queryEffect"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"mutationEffect"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcessEffect"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The component should call the domain operation. It should not resolve the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"repository, call "},{"t":"code","text":"Effect.runPromise"},{"t":"text","text":", start a fiber from a click handler or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"duplicate the domain state in a Craft "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"_3-pilot-one-read-only-feature","children":[{"t":"text","text":"3. Pilot one read-only feature"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Start with a page that has:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one query;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one application or route Layer;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one loading state;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one typed business error;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one technical error path;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one executable test."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This exposes the real cost of the Craft UI model without mixing in forms,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"optimistic updates or server-function transport."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"_4-add-writes-and-forms","children":[{"t":"text","text":"4. Add writes and forms"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Once the read path is stable, add "},{"t":"code","text":"mutationEffect"},{"t":"text","text":", then connect it to Craft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"forms and "},{"t":"code","text":"insertReactOnMutation"},{"t":"text","text":". Keep validation responsibilities explicit:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect Schema or "},{"t":"code","text":"methodSchema"},{"t":"text","text":" validates a boundary payload;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft owns field state, validity and interaction;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect typed errors represent business rejection;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"defects remain technical failures."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"_5-introduce-route-and-feature-scopes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"5. Introduce route and feature scopes"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Move a Layer to the narrowest scope that owns it. Add the compile-time Effect"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"requirements proof for the route, and inline single-use route providers so the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"typed route collection can preserve them for the type checker."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Do this after the first feature works. The proof is valuable, but introducing"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it before the boundary is understood makes the first experiment look more"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"complex than it is."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"_6-evaluate-server-functions-separately","children":[{"t":"text","text":"6. Evaluate server functions separately"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Treat the current server-function integration as a separate experiment. Its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"transport, file conventions, middleware API and deployment integration are not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"final. Never treat a client Layer as an authentication or authorization"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"boundary; the server must verify claims again."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-can-stay-and-what-changes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What can stay and what changes?"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Existing Effect application asset"}],[{"t":"text","text":"During a Craft pilot"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"Domain types and business operations"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Tagged errors and error unions"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep; map at the Craft boundary"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"Context.Service"},{"t":"text","text":" contracts"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Live and test "},{"t":"code","text":"Layer"},{"t":"text","text":"s"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep; expose through "},{"t":"code","text":"provideLayer"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Effect unit tests"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Existing UI components and templates"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep outside the pilot; replace only the selected Craft feature"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"UI loading, cancellation and rendering state"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Move to Craft resources"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"URL state and form interaction"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Model with Craft primitives and forms"}]]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"go-no-go-signals","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Go / no-go signals"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Proceed when the pilot has a clear resource boundary, an executable Layer setup"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and tests that distinguish business errors from defects."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pause and resolve the issue before expanding when:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the project is still on Effect 3 without an isolation plan;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"SSR is mandatory but no SSR host has been selected;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the team cannot explain which side owns a piece of state;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"every feature requires a custom bridge or manual subscription;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"typecheck time or type errors make the feedback loop unacceptable."}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"recommended-path","text":"Recommended path"},{"level":3,"id":"_0-establish-the-constraints","text":"0. Establish the constraints"},{"level":3,"id":"_1-keep-the-domain-in-effect","text":"1. Keep the domain in Effect"},{"level":3,"id":"_2-add-the-craft-boundary","text":"2. Add the Craft boundary"},{"level":3,"id":"_3-pilot-one-read-only-feature","text":"3. Pilot one read-only feature"},{"level":3,"id":"_4-add-writes-and-forms","text":"4. Add writes and forms"},{"level":3,"id":"_5-introduce-route-and-feature-scopes","text":"5. Introduce route and feature scopes"},{"level":3,"id":"_6-evaluate-server-functions-separately","text":"6. Evaluate server functions separately"},{"level":2,"id":"what-can-stay-and-what-changes","text":"What can stay and what changes?"},{"level":2,"id":"go-no-go-signals","text":"Go / no-go signals"}]}